00:25:00.050 --> 00:25:17.760
<v Robyn Semien>The job was complicated at times. Like you'd see little-- you'd see it at the games sometimes. Like, you would be with Lakers fans who were just grown men with, like, their young sons, who would say, like, will you pose with my son? And you're like, yeah, sure.
<v Robyn Semien>这份工作有时很复杂。就像你有时会在比赛中看到一点点——比如，你会和那些带着年幼儿子的成年男性湖人球迷在一起，他们会说，你愿意和我儿子摆姿势吗？你会说，是的，当然。

00:25:17.760 --> 00:25:27.930
<v Robyn Semien>And then you'd, like, get in a little huddle for the picture. And then the guy would say, OK, say sexy. And you're like, uh, that seems inappropriate.
