<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Robyn was part of the most elite professional level of cheerleading. She was dancing with people who were auditioning to go on tour with Madonna. It was Los Angeles. There were celebrities everywhere. Thousands of people came to games. She got to sit courtside next to Denzel Washington.
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>Robyn是啦啦队中最精英职业水平的一部分。她和那些试镜去麦当娜巡演的人一起跳舞。那是洛杉矶。到处都是名人。成千上万的人来看比赛。她可以坐在场边Denzel Washington旁边。

00:28:32.000 --> 00:28:47.260
<v Chana Joffe-Walt>In other words, yes, moron, it was fun. It was really fun. In those moments, the rules and Lisa were not on her mind.
