00:29:40.980 --> 00:30:01.450
<v Ira Glass>Well, there's been a big, messy, fascinating story unfolding in Los Angeles for a while involving two big law enforcement agencies, the LA County Sheriff's Department, which is huge, and the FBI. A secret investigation got exposed. There were accusations and counter-accusations, clandestine recordings. And by the end, a bunch of people's careers were over.
<v Ira Glass>嗯，在洛杉矶发生了一个大而混乱、引人入胜的故事，涉及两个大型执法机构，洛杉矶县治安官部门（规模巨大）和FBI。一个秘密调查被曝光。有指控和反指控，秘密录音。最后，许多人的职业生涯结束了。

00:30:01.450 --> 00:30:13.590
<v Ira Glass>At the heart of it was this-- nobody likes to be watched and reported on, judged by some outsider. No person likes it, and no organization likes it. Nancy Updike has the story.
